<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2ƆZHN - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">2 Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwopo Ungwu Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ɔzhn</para>
  <para style="mt">Kwupu Ungwopo Ungwu Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu kwɔle onzu uwu a ka ngwu o ya wu tee &lt;&lt;Onzu Uwakɔ Ɔzhɔnu.&gt;&gt; Igboshimo o ka ngwu mu ekeka iyi kari 85 mbala kari 95 mizhikembo iyi o mba Ɔzhizɔsi. A ka a ka laa &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ kwogba mbala ɛmɛ wu&gt;&gt; iyi bɔkɔ igboshimo iluma yi akwu Ɔshɔshi mbala enzu umba o fye mawu. Ilɔ iyi kwupu kwɔlɛ gba akwu ɛshɛkwu ikpama tee enzu lɔ gyesu, mbala iyemalu mekeka iyi wazɔ ɛzu umba angba mbala ɛzu izɔma iyangba mba.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Idɛnyi I Ka Kiya Ingyinangyina ma (4-6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyemalu Mekeka Iyi Wazɔ ɛzu Iyangba (7-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iso Iyi Imbwama (12-13)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Imi Ɔzhɔnu onzu uwakɔ uwu ɔshɔshi gba mi ka kwupu kwɔlɛ le laa ɛnɛ kwogba mbala ɛmɛ wu umba bɔkɔ mi pwu idɛnyi mba gyɔɔ awu. Akwu Imi kɛɛkyi mo, i kyo enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yitu iyi ongbulolo, o pwu idɛnyi ŋɔ, tete <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />kwuwongu ongbulolo awu e yi meka nzu ba ee yi mbala nzu iyɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Ukpo ete nzu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Umɛ wu le shi nzu esheshi, mbala eyembembyi mbala idigbomo iyi ongbulolo mbala idɛnyi iyi esu.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ongbulolo Mbala Idɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Mi yi ɔnyɛ gyɔɔ bɔkɔ mi ma te ɛmɛ ŋɔ umbafo o yi mu luzɛ mu ongbulolo kyamate bɔkɔ Ada a ta nzu ɔkpa te la ki wo tayi. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ɛnɛ uwu kwogba mi kpa ŋa ɛshɛku te: la ki gyi esu. Akwu wu ɔkpa uwepo gba mi ka yi le mo, akwu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ngbaa mu iyemo awu. Mi kpa yi ɛshɛku te la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi esu. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Idɛnyi gba i yi tee: la ki mbwalu ɔkpa wu, mate bɔkɔ lu pwa yi mu iyemo awu, ɔkpa wu gba akwu tee: la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi esu.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Enzu wa kyoro enzu mo riba riba umba bɔkɔ o nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mu ɛnwu iyi onzu mo, o fu kwudu munamuna-a. Enzu mbɔlɛ te lɛɛbi akwu wa kyoro enzu mo mbala agewa umba Okrasi. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />La lu ngbɛndu kaa ɛduma iyi Ukpo iyi lu wo awu la kwa yi ishi mo, kaa la lu na rigbɛ yi duduu. <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kyo iyawu ba a ra la ɛzɔ iyi Okrasi mo e yi Ukpo mo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ra la ɛzɔ ɛlɛ e yi Ada mbala Umɛ. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e bo mogba yi bɔkɔ ɛzɔ wu akwu ɛlɛ mo, la lu na wu kaa la lu shi wu mogba yi mo. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na onzu ele te de ba e kyo mu ɛduma iyira wu ɛnyi tete.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ mi gyi te la mi so yi le i yi gyɔɔ, Imi ba mi gyi la mi ka yi mu kwupu mbala keshi mo. Mi shi egbo te mi nyɔ munyi yi, gba mi bomo ki ma eyi iyi esu akwɛyi ki so iso gba ɔnyɛ nzu a nyɔlɔma le.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Ɛmɛ umba umanyi okokpayi o ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma ma.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>